direction: down
android: Android {class: you}
others: Desktop, terminal, iPod, web
host: "nori-host: the session"
core: "nori-core: profiles, library, queue"
engine: "nori-engine: the player thread"
player: "nori-player: decode, sound chain"
output: Platform audio output
source: Server or plugin

android -> core: uniffi calls
android -> engine: JNI doors
others -> host: Handle calls
host -> core: reads, queue edits
host -> engine: commands
engine -> core: queue, settings, stream addresses
engine -> player: runs
engine -> output: samples, through a ring
core -> source: HTTP
